  "description": "RepoDb extension for ClickHouse, built on the official ClickHouse.Driver ADO.NET provider. Provides a ClickHouse-aware IDbSetting/IDbHelper/IStatementBuilder (backtick quoting, LIMIT/OFFSET pagination, ALTER TABLE mutations for UPDATE/DELETE, INSERT-based MERGE fallback), a RepoDbClickHouseConnection that transparently rewrites RepoDb's \"@name\" parameters into ClickHouse.Driver's native \"{name:Type}\" substitution syntax, and a native RowBinary bulk-insert path for high-throughput ingestion. Compatible with RepoDb 1.15.1+ and ClickHouse.Driver 1.3.0+.",
  "iconFile": "icon.png",
