  "packageSize": 51970,
  "projectUrl": "https://github.com/maurosoft1973/maurosoft-repodb-clickhouse",
  "published": "2026-08-07T15:29:38.873Z",
  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "Updated for RepoDb 1.15.1 and ClickHouse.Driver 1.3.0 compatibility:\n            - Added RepoDbClickHouseConnection, which rewrites RepoDb's ADO.NET \"@name\" parameters into ClickHouse.Driver's native \"{name:Type}\" substitution syntax before every execution (ClickHouse.Driver 1.3+ no longer understands \"@name\" at all).\n            - Added a no-op transaction (BeginTransaction) so RepoDb's implicit transactions around batch operations (InsertAllAsync, DeleteAllAsync, UpdateAllAsync) no longer fail against ClickHouse, which has no ACID transactions.\n            - Rewrote ClickHouseStatementBuilder for RepoDb 1.15.1's IStatementBuilder contract: correct LIMIT/OFFSET pagination, ALTER TABLE mutations for UPDATE/DELETE, INSERT-based MERGE/MERGE ALL fallback, and a single multi-VALUES INSERT ALL statement.\n            - Fixed schema introspection (system.columns) for ClickHouse.Driver 1.3's native parameter syntax and UInt8-to-byte column mapping.\n            - Added native RowBinary bulk insert (BulkInsertAsync) with streaming (IAsyncEnumerable) support, tunable batching/parallelism, and diagnostics.\n            - Removed ClickHouseConnectionExtensions: its convenience wrappers recursed into themselves and crashed with a StackOverflowException; RepoDb's own IDbConnection extensions are used directly instead.\n            - Full XML documentation across the public and internal API surface.\n            - Added a GitHub Actions CI/CD pipeline (build, unit + Testcontainers integration tests, NuGet pack/publish, GitHub Release) with Codecov coverage reporting.",
